OL,3,GNEWSA50 years of national bus services
OL,4,Acelebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition celebrating 50 years
OL,7,Fof bus travel on the Isle of Man has
OL,8,Flaunched.
OL,10,FThe display at the House of Manannan,
OL,11,Fin Peel, focuses on the island's
OL,12,Fpublicly-owned bus service and has been
OL,13,Fput together by Manx National Heritage
OL,14,Fand Bus Vannin.
OL,16,FThe exhibition, called A Bus Service,
OL,17,Fcharts the evolution of the service
OL,18,Ffrom its nationalisation, through bendy
OL,19,Fbus and electric bus trials, to the
OL,20,Fcurrent fleet and brings together
OL,21,Fphotographs and memorabilia, along with
OL,22,Finteractive activities for children.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
