OL,3,GNEWSA50 years of national bus services
OL,4,Acelebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore the nationalisation, buses were
OL,7,Frun by two separate companies - the
OL,8,FDouglas Corporation Transport
OL,9,FDepartment, which served the capital
OL,10,Fand the surrounding area, and Isle of
OL,11,FMan Road Service Ltd, which ran
OL,12,Fservices between town and villages
OL,13,Felsewhere.
